            "review_title": "Review at SCMC clubhouse",
            "review_text": "Kai Suwandi Handoyo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam93 contributions\n0\nCool place to hang out\nMay 2023 • Friends\nSuper chill and cool hang out place. Many bikers frequent this joint especially on the weekends for brunch and afternoon coffee. Perfect place to check out the big motorcycle scene in HCMC. The bar is also well stocked with nice whisky if that’s your kind of drink. There is a high end Japanese denim store on second floor along with imported motorcycle gears and lifestyle apparel.\nRead more\nWritten July 30, 2023",
